.TH "bead recurrence history" 1  "bead recurrence history " 
.SH NAME
bead recurrence history \- Show materialization history for a template
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead recurrence history\fR <\fB\-\-id\fR> [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Display the complete materialization history for a recurrence template,
showing all created occurrences with their sequence numbers and timestamps.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-id\fR=\fIID\fR
Template ID
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
